gress","AI analytics","Predictive project management"]},{"type":"p","text":"A future Construction Manager should therefore understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"4D/5D modelling"},{"text":"Construction analytics"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Drones"},{"text":"IoT"},{"text":"AI/computer vision"},{"text":"Cloud collaboration"},{"text":"Automated reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The manager doesn't need to become a software developer, but must understand how these technologies affect schedule, cost, quality, safety, and productivity."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"flow","items":["Civil/Construction Engineering","Construction Methods","Structural Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project controls"},{"type":"flow","items":["Primavera","Scheduling","Cost Control","Risk Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"flow","items":["BOQ","Estimation","Billing","Contracts","Procurement"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Site"},{"type":"flow","items":["Execution","QA/QC","HSE","Contractor Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"flow","items":["BIM","Revit","Navisworks","Excel","Power BI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"flow","items":["Communication","Negotiation","Decision-making","Team Management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Year 1","Civil/construction fundamentals + AutoCAD + Excel","Year 2","Construction methods + estimation + BOQ + costing","Year 3","Primavera + BIM + QA/QC + HSE + internship","Year 4","Project controls + contracts + risk + cost + major project"]},{"type":"h","text":"First job\nGraduate Engineer / Site Engineer / Planning Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"3–6 years\nProject Engineer / Senior Site Engineer / Senior Planning Engineer"},{"type":"h","text":"6–10 years\nAssistant Construction Manager / Project Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"8–15+ y